Scope of this license:

This MIT License covers all source code in this repository (.gd, .gdshader,
.tscn, .tres files, plus the HTML/Three.js validation prototype in
index.html). It explicitly does NOT cover the following, which retain
separate licensing terms:

  - Visual game assets (icons, fonts, images) — see ATTRIBUTIONS.md
  - Audio assets (music, SFX) — see ATTRIBUTIONS.md
  - Game-design documents, story texts, world-building texts in docs/ — all
    rights reserved by the studio
  - Brand identity, game title, logo — all rights reserved by the studio
  - Localization translations (when added in Phase 3) — separately licensed
    per translator agreement, see ATTRIBUTIONS.md

Third-party dependencies (Godot Engine, GodotSteam, Three.js, etc.) retain
their own licenses as documented in ATTRIBUTIONS.md.
